    },
    {
      "id": "deadline-calculation",
      "text": "When NewTimer, AfterFunc, or a valid Timer.Reset computes a deadline, a zero or negative duration yields the current runtime clock reading. A positive duration is added to that reading, and a sum that wraps below zero is replaced with MaxInt64 before the deadline is passed to the runtime.",
      "citation": {
